                                                "sense_id": "88fe6bc5-99d2-3681-8dee-d43575325566",
                                                "text": "I actually never got a trainer for RCT, but needed one for my brother when I installed it on his computer. He is 10, and is only concerned with making \"cool\" coasters. I also completed CF before getting trainers."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d9074bb-615b-46f0-b082-a8cddba31117",
                                                "sense_id": "88fe6bc5-99d2-3681-8dee-d43575325566",
